WEBVTT

00:00:02.430 --> 00:00:04.700
I finally found it, the Daisakkai.

00:00:05.270 --> 00:00:06.900
If that is destroyed...

00:00:08.170 --> 00:00:11.610
Then I can cut off
Sekidousai's power source.

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:18.480
Cheap construction.

00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:24.020
Well, isn't that my descendant?

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:25.350
Sekidousai.

00:00:25.350 --> 00:00:28.490
Good job finding this secret base.

00:00:29.830 --> 00:00:31.490
Look at you.

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:35.030
Don't you have any manners as a gentleman?

00:00:35.530 --> 00:00:39.040
You shouldn't be telling me.
More importantly, what's that?

00:00:39.270 --> 00:00:41.700
That? Well, that is...

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:50.850
I guess I can call it "Fruits of Despair."

00:00:51.510 --> 00:00:53.920
Fruits of Despair?

00:01:04.760 --> 00:01:08.530
<i>Can I keep on praying?</i>

00:01:08.530 --> 00:01:11.900
<i>Can I keep on believing?</i>

00:01:11.900 --> 00:01:18.770
<i>Oh light that shines</i> <i>in the forest of despair</i>

00:01:29.320 --> 00:01:35.290
<i>I kick the cold ground with my toes</i>

00:01:36.060 --> 00:01:42.400
<i>My brushed hair</i> <i>dances in the moonlit night</i>

00:01:42.400 --> 00:01:48.970
<i>Let's throw away your</i> <i>frightened eyes and loneliness</i>

00:01:49.300 --> 00:01:56.680
<i>Those days when acting tough</i> <i>was your only friend...</i>

00:01:56.680 --> 00:02:01.380
<i>Leave that in the distance</i>

00:02:01.380 --> 00:02:05.320
<i>Is my salvation over there?</i>

00:02:05.320 --> 00:02:08.660
<i>Can I heal this deep darkness?</i>

00:02:08.660 --> 00:02:14.260
<i>Is it okay for me to seek warmth?</i>

00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:18.630
<i>I want to be stronger</i> <i>than anyone else</i>

00:02:18.630 --> 00:02:21.840
<i>I want to protect my loved ones</i>

00:02:21.840 --> 00:02:28.010
<i>Oh light that continues</i> <i>to shine on me</i>

00:02:29.080 --> 00:02:33.980
Father and Groom!

00:02:35.050 --> 00:02:38.890
Dai Yoko's revival must be stopped no matter what.

00:02:38.890 --> 00:02:42.260
As you all know, his power is extraordinary.

00:02:42.260 --> 00:02:44.760
If he doesn't like it, he'll blow away a mountain,

00:02:44.760 --> 00:02:46.800
and cause a flood if it's too hot.

00:02:47.130 --> 00:02:52.200
If he is released, then this world will fall into chaos.

00:02:52.970 --> 00:02:56.210
But, I am not worried at all.

00:02:56.610 --> 00:02:58.540
Members of the Kawahira family.

00:02:58.540 --> 00:03:01.010
And the Inukami as well.

00:03:01.010 --> 00:03:04.550
We've been through a lot.
I've known you since you were little.

00:03:04.550 --> 00:03:06.480
You all have incredible powers.

00:03:06.480 --> 00:03:09.250
So is your bravery.

00:03:09.520 --> 00:03:13.860
That's right. By combining our powers, this will not be impossible.

00:03:13.860 --> 00:03:18.330
Even if we're up against Dai Yoko, we can seal him again.

00:03:19.030 --> 00:03:22.530
That's right. Just seal Dai Yoko away.

00:03:23.570 --> 00:03:26.700
But before that, I need to do this.

00:03:32.510 --> 00:03:33.240
Me?

00:03:33.740 --> 00:03:37.280
What are you wearing in this emergency?

00:03:43.750 --> 00:03:45.650
Geez, give me a break.

00:03:45.650 --> 00:03:49.390
You reap what you sow.
You look so stupid.

00:03:49.390 --> 00:03:51.730
Listen to you.

00:03:51.730 --> 00:03:55.160
You were really worried about him just now.

00:03:55.160 --> 00:03:57.870
"Master Keita is late.
Will he make it?"

00:03:57.870 --> 00:03:59.070
I was not!

00:03:59.070 --> 00:04:00.970
So, what's happening?

00:04:00.970 --> 00:04:05.440
Dai Yoko's power is increasing and the barrier is weakening.

00:04:05.980 --> 00:04:10.080
We tried to reinforce it with the animal barrier.

00:04:10.350 --> 00:04:12.920
But it wasn't as effective as we hoped.

00:04:13.150 --> 00:04:15.990
Now that it has come to this, we have decided.

00:04:15.990 --> 00:04:19.490
We'll use the ultimate barrier, the Fan Barrier.

00:04:19.490 --> 00:04:22.160
Fan Barrier? But that's...

00:04:22.160 --> 00:04:26.030
Yeah. If possible,
I don't want to use it.

00:04:26.430 --> 00:04:28.660
It's a burden for the Great Elder.

00:04:29.230 --> 00:04:33.400
But we can seal him for another 300 years.

00:04:33.400 --> 00:04:36.840
The Great Elder himself said there's no need to worry.

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:41.080
I see. So he's prepared to do that much.

00:04:41.580 --> 00:04:45.050
The Great Elder is incredible.

00:04:50.350 --> 00:04:52.190
Did somebody talk about me?

00:04:52.660 --> 00:04:54.560
Are you sure about him?

00:04:54.860 --> 00:04:58.830
While the Fan Barrier obviously needs the Great Elder's power,

00:04:58.830 --> 00:05:00.830
we would need everyone else's power too.

00:05:01.100 --> 00:05:04.200
Indeed. We need an abundance of spiritual power.

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:07.670
Yes. Please help us too, Keita.

00:05:08.500 --> 00:05:10.170
But, I have one condition.

00:05:11.410 --> 00:05:13.680
Give me a paradise.

00:05:14.610 --> 00:05:17.510
Give me all of your Inukami.

00:05:17.510 --> 00:05:19.450
No complaints. Obey everything.

00:05:21.680 --> 00:05:24.190
Master Keita.

00:05:28.660 --> 00:05:31.130
You're always like this!

00:05:31.130 --> 00:05:33.730
I'm sick of this violent girl!

00:05:36.070 --> 00:05:37.670
Will you help too, Yoko?

00:05:38.630 --> 00:05:40.170
- Me?
- Yes.

00:05:42.170 --> 00:05:43.670
- I...
- Wait.

00:05:44.110 --> 00:05:47.240
I heard that she is
Dai Yoko's daughter.

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:49.680
You trust someone like her?

00:05:50.080 --> 00:05:52.450
What if she betrays us midway?

00:05:52.450 --> 00:05:53.680
That's...

00:05:54.880 --> 00:05:56.590
But Yoko is...

00:05:56.590 --> 00:05:58.920
It's fine, Hake. I'm used to it.

00:05:59.490 --> 00:06:01.960
I can't possibly trust you.

00:06:01.960 --> 00:06:03.360
You want to get burned?

00:06:03.690 --> 00:06:05.790
What's wrong, girl?

00:06:06.360 --> 00:06:07.700
Tomohane.

00:06:08.460 --> 00:06:10.000
I can't involve her.

00:06:11.070 --> 00:06:13.470
Hey, don't run away.

00:06:13.470 --> 00:06:14.340
Whoops.

00:06:15.770 --> 00:06:19.240
Oh? My bad. Are you okay?

00:06:19.240 --> 00:06:20.910
Don't you interfere.

00:06:21.280 --> 00:06:23.450
Oh, how scary.

00:06:23.450 --> 00:06:24.910
I'll be running away then.

00:06:25.310 --> 00:06:26.620
Keita.

00:06:28.120 --> 00:06:29.520
Hey, wait!

00:06:31.920 --> 00:06:35.990
How fitting, the daughter of a monster and Kawahira family's failure.

00:06:35.990 --> 00:06:37.230
That's enough.

00:06:46.940 --> 00:06:50.040
Oh, were you looking for me?

00:06:50.040 --> 00:06:51.570
Not really.

00:06:51.570 --> 00:06:54.410
It's just tiring to be around so many people.

00:06:55.980 --> 00:06:58.650
So you are worried about me.

00:06:58.650 --> 00:07:01.120
I told you, it's not like that.

00:07:01.120 --> 00:07:02.750
Phew.

00:07:08.420 --> 00:07:12.260
You know, I never laughed when I was a kid.

00:07:14.600 --> 00:07:18.930
I didn't know about being happy or having fun back then.

00:07:20.340 --> 00:07:22.940
The reason Dad tried to conquer this mountain

00:07:22.940 --> 00:07:25.310
was to find a place for me to nap.

00:07:26.910 --> 00:07:28.280
That's so messed up.

00:07:28.280 --> 00:07:33.120
But even as he did so,
I didn't feel anything.

00:07:33.450 --> 00:07:35.950
Not a bit happy or excited.

00:07:38.350 --> 00:07:41.560
In the end, Dad got captured.

00:07:41.560 --> 00:07:43.960
And I was locked away on this mountain.

00:07:44.530 --> 00:07:48.160
I'm Dai Yoko's daughter, so they were really afraid of me.

00:07:49.000 --> 00:07:53.300
So, what do you think will happen if you're being looked at like that?

00:07:55.740 --> 00:07:57.740
You get really mad.

00:08:01.180 --> 00:08:03.210
I couldn't take it anymore.

00:08:03.210 --> 00:08:05.450
I didn't care what happened.

00:08:05.450 --> 00:08:07.250
So I ran away.

00:08:07.250 --> 00:08:08.420
Crimson!

00:08:18.090 --> 00:08:19.830
It was then.

00:08:23.600 --> 00:08:27.340
I thought he would fear me, just like the Inukami.

00:08:28.340 --> 00:08:29.340
But...

00:08:47.760 --> 00:08:50.530
Wait, could it be...

00:08:52.790 --> 00:08:55.130
Then after about three days,

00:08:55.130 --> 00:08:57.000
he came to the mountain every day.

00:08:57.900 --> 00:09:00.170
We ran and played together.

00:09:00.700 --> 00:09:02.970
I felt something weird.

00:09:03.970 --> 00:09:07.040
That's when
I smiled for the first time.

00:09:08.880 --> 00:09:11.480
I laughed for the first time.

00:09:23.890 --> 00:09:28.260
After that, I was caught and brought back to the mountain.

00:09:30.600 --> 00:09:33.300
That's when I found out who he was.

00:09:33.300 --> 00:09:35.040
He was a Kawahira.

00:09:35.400 --> 00:09:37.040
That's why I said this.

00:09:37.910 --> 00:09:40.580
"I want to be
Keita Kawahira's Inukami."

00:09:40.580 --> 00:09:41.380
Ouch.

00:09:43.510 --> 00:09:46.550
After that it was nothing but trouble.

00:09:46.550 --> 00:09:48.380
But I worked hard.

00:09:48.380 --> 00:09:49.590
But...

00:09:49.590 --> 00:09:53.620
After we met again,
I experienced many fun things.

00:09:53.620 --> 00:09:55.560
I found many things I like.

00:09:56.120 --> 00:09:59.360
I like chocolate cake and I like that city.

00:09:59.360 --> 00:10:03.330
I like Nadeshiko, Tomohane, and the rest of the girls.

00:10:03.330 --> 00:10:05.630
But Dad...

00:10:08.340 --> 00:10:10.240
He would destroy them all.

00:10:10.870 --> 00:10:13.710
I don't want what I like to be destroyed.

00:10:19.450 --> 00:10:22.780
Was Yoko this...

00:10:23.790 --> 00:10:24.850
Keita?

00:10:26.720 --> 00:10:29.360
Yoko, I...

00:10:33.900 --> 00:10:37.430
They're laughing, our kids.

00:10:39.000 --> 00:10:40.440
No!

00:10:40.440 --> 00:10:42.240
Anything but that!

00:10:42.240 --> 00:10:44.370
You two, please come back.

00:10:45.070 --> 00:10:47.540
Master Kaoru is about to start.

00:10:47.880 --> 00:10:49.180
Thank God.

00:10:49.180 --> 00:10:50.250
What?

00:10:50.250 --> 00:10:51.880
Please...

00:10:52.180 --> 00:10:54.380
Save me!

00:10:55.450 --> 00:10:57.550
What are you doing, pervert?

00:10:57.550 --> 00:10:59.090
Geez, Keita.

00:11:01.560 --> 00:11:03.060
But...

00:11:04.190 --> 00:11:06.500
So that was Yoko.

00:11:07.060 --> 00:11:08.300
Wait.

00:11:09.030 --> 00:11:12.030
It's kind of different from how I remember it.

00:11:16.740 --> 00:11:18.570
Hey, Dai Yoko.

00:11:18.570 --> 00:11:20.780
The Kawahira's family head, huh?

00:11:20.780 --> 00:11:23.780
What's with this huge gathering?

00:11:24.150 --> 00:11:28.880
How about staying quiet down there just like how you've been?

00:11:32.820 --> 00:11:36.360
Kiss my butt!

00:11:37.790 --> 00:11:39.260
Converter, forward.

00:11:42.100 --> 00:11:46.840
Great Elder?

00:11:47.640 --> 00:11:49.400
Sorry about that.

00:11:51.810 --> 00:11:53.310
Amplifier, forward.

00:11:53.680 --> 00:11:56.680
Kaoru, it's an important role, but don't worry.

00:11:56.680 --> 00:11:58.450
You can do it.

00:11:58.450 --> 00:11:59.680
Understood.

00:12:02.480 --> 00:12:03.820
It's finally time.

00:12:05.490 --> 00:12:07.460
Even Keita is serious.

00:12:08.890 --> 00:12:11.760
I don't want to be the dad of puppies.

00:12:13.630 --> 00:12:17.300
That formation, where have I seen it before?

00:12:20.070 --> 00:12:21.440
I remember.

00:12:21.440 --> 00:12:23.810
That was 300 years ago.

00:12:23.810 --> 00:12:25.310
Is Yoko there too?

00:12:26.370 --> 00:12:27.480
Dad.

00:12:32.480 --> 00:12:36.450
Purification Barrier
Special Technique, Fan Barrier.

00:12:41.120 --> 00:12:42.260
"Inukami!"

00:12:42.490 --> 00:12:43.990
Woof woof.

00:12:51.600 --> 00:12:54.140
Not bad.

00:12:59.170 --> 00:13:03.250
Concentrate our spiritual power to a single point.

00:13:04.950 --> 00:13:09.350
Kaoru who receives it will amplify it, then send it to Great Elder.

00:13:10.890 --> 00:13:13.420
Through Great Elder's technique,

00:13:13.420 --> 00:13:17.260
it'll be transformed into a seal with massive energy.

00:13:17.690 --> 00:13:18.060
Fan Barrier

00:13:18.060 --> 00:13:21.860
That's the Purification Barrier
Special Technique, Fan Barrier.

00:13:21.860 --> 00:13:24.130
I won't let you!

00:13:30.010 --> 00:13:31.540
His power is weakening.

00:13:31.540 --> 00:13:33.780
We can do this!

00:13:34.380 --> 00:13:36.580
Dad, please stay still.

00:13:36.580 --> 00:13:40.020
Darn you!

00:13:41.380 --> 00:13:42.880
This is...

00:13:46.120 --> 00:13:48.190
The spiritual power isn't flowing.

00:13:48.890 --> 00:13:50.130
Kaoru.

00:13:55.260 --> 00:13:58.270
So this body isn't good enough, after all?

00:13:58.270 --> 00:14:00.340
Are you all right, Master Kaoru?

00:14:00.340 --> 00:14:02.870
I'm fine. More importantly...

00:14:06.310 --> 00:14:07.380
No.

00:14:08.080 --> 00:14:09.850
Phew, that was close.

00:14:12.280 --> 00:14:16.480
Man, this world's air sure is nice.

00:14:18.250 --> 00:14:20.620
Umm, who are you?

00:14:21.320 --> 00:14:22.720
Me? I'm Dai Yoko.

00:14:22.720 --> 00:14:24.630
What?

00:14:24.630 --> 00:14:26.800
You look so modern.

00:14:26.800 --> 00:14:28.900
Oh, this thing?

00:14:28.900 --> 00:14:30.670
My aura was seeping out.

00:14:30.670 --> 00:14:34.600
I saw the state of the world through that.

00:14:34.600 --> 00:14:35.540
Looks bad?

00:14:35.540 --> 00:14:36.810
It's great...

00:14:37.140 --> 00:14:39.980
- Maybe he isn't that scary?
- Maybe.

00:14:39.980 --> 00:14:41.280
Now then.

00:14:42.110 --> 00:14:43.280
Yoko?

00:14:43.280 --> 00:14:45.580
- What's wrong? You okay?
- Yeah.

00:14:45.580 --> 00:14:47.420
You're in the way.

00:14:47.420 --> 00:14:49.320
Buzz off.

00:14:51.320 --> 00:14:52.850
Dad.

00:14:54.090 --> 00:14:57.130
My dear Yoko. You've grown so much.

00:14:57.130 --> 00:15:00.500
You're full of energy as usual, Dad.

00:15:00.500 --> 00:15:03.370
But that energy is also troublesome.

00:15:04.300 --> 00:15:06.670
Now, be quiet and get back inside the barrier.

00:15:07.200 --> 00:15:10.810
Oh, my sunshine. What are you saying?

00:15:10.810 --> 00:15:11.940
Now.

00:15:12.270 --> 00:15:13.880
You poor little thing.

00:15:13.880 --> 00:15:17.650
Did some bad Inukami trick you into saying that?

00:15:17.650 --> 00:15:19.750
Hey, cut it out. It's embarrassing.

00:15:20.050 --> 00:15:22.550
I haven't felt my daughter in a long time.

00:15:22.550 --> 00:15:23.890
Stop it, really.

00:15:23.890 --> 00:15:25.320
Is he dumb?

00:15:25.320 --> 00:15:26.290
Very.

00:15:26.790 --> 00:15:28.160
Dai Yoko.

00:15:28.660 --> 00:15:30.530
Stand down.

00:15:31.360 --> 00:15:33.530
You're ruining a family reunion.

00:15:34.930 --> 00:15:36.130
Punishment time.

00:15:36.130 --> 00:15:37.800
Mass Petrification.

00:15:37.800 --> 00:15:39.100
Everyone, run.

00:15:46.370 --> 00:15:47.580
In an instant.

00:15:47.980 --> 00:15:49.080
He's...

00:15:49.480 --> 00:15:50.680
A monster!

00:15:51.810 --> 00:15:54.350
There, no more bad guys.

00:15:54.350 --> 00:15:57.790
You idiot!
Turn everyone back right now!

00:15:57.790 --> 00:15:59.290
This should wake you up.

00:15:59.290 --> 00:16:01.220
You've got it wrong.

00:16:01.220 --> 00:16:02.720
Thanks.

00:16:02.720 --> 00:16:04.630
Your barrier saved me.

00:16:04.630 --> 00:16:05.430
Yes.

00:16:05.430 --> 00:16:09.000
But what is that idiot father thinking?

00:16:09.000 --> 00:16:11.300
Hey, you. Did you say something?

00:16:12.570 --> 00:16:16.440
You were standing next to my cute Yoko. Who are you?

00:16:17.010 --> 00:16:19.770
I'm Yoko's Inukami User.

00:16:19.770 --> 00:16:21.140
- You are?
- Yeah.

00:16:22.580 --> 00:16:24.210
- Really?
- Yeah.

00:16:28.520 --> 00:16:30.020
What's going on?

00:16:30.020 --> 00:16:33.620
You're my cute Yoko's Inukami User?
With that perverted clothing?

00:16:33.620 --> 00:16:35.460
It's not like I want to wear this!

00:16:35.460 --> 00:16:36.830
Hang on now.

00:16:36.830 --> 00:16:40.030
By Inukami User, you mean you both live together?

00:16:40.030 --> 00:16:41.260
Yes.

00:16:41.900 --> 00:16:47.470
If this pervert lives with my Yoko,
I can't imagine what he'd do.

00:16:47.470 --> 00:16:49.040
There's no doubt...

00:16:51.910 --> 00:16:55.240
Umm, Yoko and I haven't done anything...

00:16:55.240 --> 00:16:55.940
Really?

00:16:55.940 --> 00:16:57.050
Yes.

00:16:57.880 --> 00:16:59.280
Thank goodness.

00:16:59.280 --> 00:17:02.580
Then, my cute Yoko will now live with me.

00:17:02.580 --> 00:17:03.590
Right?

00:17:03.590 --> 00:17:04.850
Let me go.

00:17:04.850 --> 00:17:08.020
Just like old times now.
We'll bathe together too.

00:17:08.020 --> 00:17:10.490
I hate you, Dad.

00:17:10.490 --> 00:17:14.360
I only take baths together with Keita.

00:17:15.860 --> 00:17:20.200
That's right. Keita and I have bathed together many times.

00:17:20.200 --> 00:17:22.440
Is that true?

00:17:22.440 --> 00:17:24.740
But that pervert just now said...

00:17:24.740 --> 00:17:27.340
He's lying because you scared him.

00:17:27.980 --> 00:17:32.750
And besides, we have done it a lot.

00:17:32.750 --> 00:17:34.850
Done it?

00:17:37.390 --> 00:17:40.190
Keita's always energetic at night.

00:17:40.620 --> 00:17:42.960
He won't let me sleep.

00:17:43.260 --> 00:17:45.830
He can go so many times.

00:17:48.330 --> 00:17:49.460
How could it be?

00:17:49.460 --> 00:17:51.370
Why are you making up stuff?

00:17:52.100 --> 00:17:54.440
That's morning sickness, Yoko.

00:17:54.440 --> 00:17:55.140
I knew it.

00:17:59.610 --> 00:18:00.640
You...

00:18:00.640 --> 00:18:02.780
Um, no, this is...

00:18:03.140 --> 00:18:06.250
Causality, bow down before me.

00:18:12.990 --> 00:18:15.290
Can't have the groom looking like that.

00:18:15.290 --> 00:18:17.560
So I turned back time a bit.

00:18:17.560 --> 00:18:19.630
My first grandchild!
Take good care of it.

00:18:21.230 --> 00:18:22.800
Be happy.

00:18:22.800 --> 00:18:24.270
Thanks, Dad.

00:18:28.540 --> 00:18:29.740
They're back.

00:18:29.740 --> 00:18:34.010
I see, Dai Yoko turned back time. That's why.

00:18:35.380 --> 00:18:37.110
So, what are you going to do?

00:18:37.110 --> 00:18:38.850
Rampaging again?

00:18:38.850 --> 00:18:41.280
Well, I'll take a break from that.

00:18:41.280 --> 00:18:43.590
It won't be good for my Yoko's baby.

00:18:45.250 --> 00:18:47.260
We're saved.

00:18:47.260 --> 00:18:49.720
What? This quickly?

00:18:49.720 --> 00:18:51.830
That is good.

00:18:52.230 --> 00:18:54.860
Should we read a wedding poem?

00:18:54.860 --> 00:18:57.900
Will the wedding be
Japanese or Western style?

00:18:57.900 --> 00:18:59.530
I wonder which.

00:18:59.530 --> 00:19:00.700
Hang on!

00:19:00.700 --> 00:19:03.370
Don't ignore me and continue on with the story.

00:19:04.010 --> 00:19:06.010
You don't hate Yoko.

00:19:06.010 --> 00:19:07.780
But this is different.

00:19:07.780 --> 00:19:11.550
If he finds out it was a lie, it'll start another war.

00:19:12.180 --> 00:19:13.350
But still...

00:19:13.350 --> 00:19:16.180
You will definitely be killed by Dad.

00:19:16.620 --> 00:19:19.220
Your sacrifice shall not be in vain.

00:19:19.220 --> 00:19:20.860
But...

00:19:24.890 --> 00:19:28.900
I've been tricked.

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:32.570
It's happily ever after.

00:19:32.570 --> 00:19:33.670
Yay.

00:19:34.500 --> 00:19:36.340
Keita sure has it rough.

00:19:36.340 --> 00:19:38.940
But I'm a bit jealous.

00:19:44.980 --> 00:19:47.980
Yoko's Days

00:19:47.980 --> 00:19:49.350
What's that?

00:19:49.720 --> 00:19:52.720
This? This is "Yoko's Days."

00:19:52.720 --> 00:19:53.890
"Yoko's Days"?

00:19:54.360 --> 00:19:57.460
It's a picture diary I made about your growth.

00:19:58.130 --> 00:20:00.830
It's to remember your past.

00:20:02.860 --> 00:20:05.830
I guess I have to put your wedding picture here soon.

00:20:05.830 --> 00:20:07.870
Stop it, it's embarrassing.

00:20:07.870 --> 00:20:09.940
You idiot. It's a bad hobby.

00:20:09.940 --> 00:20:12.110
I hate you, Dad.

00:20:12.110 --> 00:20:13.910
Hate?

00:20:15.580 --> 00:20:16.780
What a drag.

00:20:16.780 --> 00:20:20.110
Come now. Your daughter's happiness is close at hand.

00:20:20.110 --> 00:20:21.720
How can a father be like that?

00:20:22.020 --> 00:20:23.790
Well, that's true.

00:20:23.790 --> 00:20:26.620
But I wanted to have tons of fun before that.

00:20:26.620 --> 00:20:29.720
What a drag!

00:20:29.720 --> 00:20:31.660
Long time no see.

00:20:35.260 --> 00:20:36.500
Sekidousai.

00:20:36.500 --> 00:20:37.700
Him?

00:20:40.600 --> 00:20:42.800
Another familiar face.

00:20:42.800 --> 00:20:45.810
I sensed your revival.

00:20:46.210 --> 00:20:48.610
I want to have a rematch with you.

00:20:48.610 --> 00:20:49.580
Sounds interesting.

00:20:49.580 --> 00:20:51.080
Dad, don't.

00:20:51.080 --> 00:20:52.910
You said you won't rampage...

00:20:52.910 --> 00:20:55.520
It's a different story with Sekidousai.

00:20:56.320 --> 00:21:00.290
You're the only opponent
I can seriously play against.

00:21:01.060 --> 00:21:02.160
Dad.

00:21:02.890 --> 00:21:03.930
Shall we?

00:21:04.560 --> 00:21:05.490
Yeah.

00:21:06.690 --> 00:21:08.960
Hey, wait up, dumb father.

00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:13.840
That's towards Kichijitsu City.

00:21:13.840 --> 00:21:14.700
Everyone.

00:21:14.700 --> 00:21:15.440
Yes.

00:21:15.440 --> 00:21:17.110
- Yoko, let's go.
- Yeah.

00:21:17.670 --> 00:21:20.140
I have to stop Dad no matter what.

00:21:37.830 --> 00:21:43.030
<i>This and that, we want everything</i>

00:21:43.030 --> 00:21:48.470
<i>We wish for love and that all</i> <i>of our dreams will come true</i>

00:21:48.470 --> 00:21:53.610
<i>Every girl is busy</i>

00:21:53.610 --> 00:21:58.850
<i>Playing, studying, going crazy</i>
<i>Our schedules are filled</i>

00:21:59.280 --> 00:22:01.850
<i>When we are about to be dumped,</i>

00:22:01.850 --> 00:22:04.450
<i>we send texts and gather</i>

00:22:04.450 --> 00:22:07.260
<i>A meeting at a family restaurant,</i>

00:22:07.260 --> 00:22:10.660
<i>and nothing makes any sense</i>

00:22:11.130 --> 00:22:13.560
<i>Oh, no. Oh, no. Oh, no</i>

00:22:13.560 --> 00:22:16.360
<i>We eat some sweets while we chat</i>

00:22:16.360 --> 00:22:21.570
<i>We can't stop, and now</i> <i>our diets are doomed too</i>

00:22:21.570 --> 00:22:23.940
<i>Oh, no. Oh, no. Oh, no</i>

00:22:23.940 --> 00:22:26.710
<i>When we go crazy together,</i>

00:22:26.710 --> 00:22:32.880
<i>we get so excited that we can</i> <i>forget our sadness a bit</i>

00:22:33.150 --> 00:22:35.580
<i>Let's go. Let's go. Fight</i>

00:22:35.580 --> 00:22:38.350
<i>Our hearts are one,</i>

00:22:38.350 --> 00:22:41.920
<i>tied by a strong bond</i> <i>called friendship</i>

00:22:50.370 --> 00:22:54.040
Inukami!

00:22:54.040 --> 00:22:54.970
See you!

00:22:55.570 --> 00:22:58.770
There are three signs of a man's youth ending.

00:22:58.770 --> 00:23:01.940
First, the fallen hairs on the pillow in the morning.

00:23:01.940 --> 00:23:04.350
"Guess I can't play around anymore."

00:23:04.350 --> 00:23:07.880
Second is marriage.
I guess I should settle down?

00:23:07.880 --> 00:23:11.820
And third. This one must be stopped at all costs.

00:23:11.820 --> 00:23:13.820
It's about a man's dignity.

00:23:14.560 --> 00:23:16.220
Next on Inukami!

00:23:16.220 --> 00:23:18.090
"Wilting Elephant!"

00:23:18.090 --> 00:23:19.960
Oh, my god!

00:23:19.960 --> 00:23:20.560
Wilting Elephant!

00:23:20.560 --> 00:23:24.370
My elephant isn't wilting just yet.

00:23:24.370 --> 00:23:24.970
Wilting Elephant!
